    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-08-17T21:20:59+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-17T21:20:59+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-17T11:50:59Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-17T11:50:59Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system over the Tasman Sea extends a ridge over South Australia. A trough of low pressure over the northeast of State on Monday gradually moves eastwards and clears to the east later Tuesday. A weakening cold front moves into far southwestern parts later on Tuesday and moves southeast across the state into Wednesday. Another high pressure system develops over the north of the state later Wednesday, with weak troughs clipping the southeast in a broad westerly flow on Thursday and Friday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-08-17T21:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-18T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-17T11:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-17T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers south of Leigh Creek, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm east of Leigh Creek. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-08-18T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-19T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-17T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-18T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of showers south of Leigh Creek, high chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending north to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 13 with daytime temperatures reaching 18 to 30.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:50am to 2:50pm, UV Index predicted to reach 5 [Moderate]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-08-19T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-20T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-18T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-19T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Medium chance of showers east of Leigh Creek, slight chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds north to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending north to northwesterly in the morning then becoming light in the late afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 15 with daytime temperatures reaching 22 to 29.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-08-20T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-21T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-19T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-20T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of showers about the Gammon Ranges, medium chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. The chance of morning fog south of Yunta. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending south to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 14 with daytime temperatures reaching 18 to 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-08-21T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-22T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-20T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-21T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. High chance of showers north of Leigh Creek, slight chance elsewhere. Winds southerly 20 to 30 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 6 and 14 with daytime temperatures reaching between 17 and 22.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
